---
description: Critical background jobs must be retry-safe, idempotent, observable and tenant-safe
globs:
  - "app/Jobs/**"
  - "app/Console/**"
  - "routes/console.php"
  - "**/*worker*"
  - "**/*queue*"
---

For important async work:
- assume duplicate delivery
- define retry/backoff/timeout
- protect external side effects with idempotency
- restore tenant context explicitly
- control concurrency where needed
- define failed-job recovery
- add observability and tests
